'' A local -- dim, static, var, const, redim, 'for', or a parameter of a definition -- may not
'' take the name of a CONST or a PROCEDURE (a declare, an overload set, its own procedure's
'' name) of the namespace or module scope its procedure or block was opened in: TKO0945.
'' Accepted, as in fbc: a shared variable or type alias of that name, one declared LATER, one
'' in an OUTER namespace or reached through 'using', a GENERIC procedure of that name, and
'' anything in a method or a generic.
'' tiko accepted all ten refusals.
''
'' MEASURED, fbc-modern 1.20.0 win64, 'fbc64 -maxerr 100 -c' on the source -- error 4 on
'' exactly the ten lines marked REFUSED, and nothing else:
''
''   outer-value-names.bas(20) C1  (21) P2  (22) P3  (23) Q1     dim in a namespace sub
''   outer-value-names.bas(30) parameter c1  (32) static p2  (34) for p3
''   outer-value-names.bas(62) var G1  (63) const F1             a function at module level
''   outer-value-names.bas(68) redim G1                          a SCOPE at module level
''
'' NOT COVERED: a local named like a NAMESPACE (fbc's error 120); tiko still accepts it.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/outer-value-names.bas
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 10
'' GOLDEN: expected/outer-value-names.out
